Error [jet.MarkedFunctionValue]: `consume` can't be used as a function value because its parameter `value` is `&&`
  --> tests/ui/ownership/named_write_and_move_functions_cannot_erase_access_as_function_values_2.jet:3:23
    |
  3 | run: fn() { callback: consume }
    |                       ^^^^^^^
 Why: A function type gives each parameter plain read access unless it marks a write (`fn(&T)`) or a take (`fn(&&T)`), so a value of `consume` would drop the `&&` its parameter declares
 Fix: Call `consume` directly, mark the parameter in the function type (`fn(&&T)`), or pass a lambda that makes that call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0227
